# Credits in the API (Core)

- **Never expose cents in the API.** Request/response bodies and query parameters must use **credits** (user-facing decimal) only.
- Convert at the boundary: use `convertCentsToCredits()` when returning data, `convertCreditsToCents()` when persisting user input. Import from `@sokosumi/utils`.

See [AGENTS.md](../AGENTS.md) (Credit Conversion, Credit Handling gotchas).
